{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">TODAY function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310835","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TODAY-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TODAY-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"TODAY-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">TODAY function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TODAY-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the current system date.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TODAY-function__syntax_GC1B1BL2705119\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d337887e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"TODAY-function__idGDP30J2677417\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>TODAY</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TODAY-function__example_GC1B1BM2705123\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d337887e122\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure prints the date in the first line at the top of each page\nof a report. Instead of using TODAY in the FORM statement, the procedure\nuses a variable to hold the date. This ensures that the same date\nappears on all pages of the report, even if this procedure runs\nthrough midnight. </p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-today.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"TODAY-function__idGDP30K2677421\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE rptdate AS DATE NO-UNDO.\n\nOUTPUT TO PRINTER.\n\nrptdate = <strong class=\"ph b\">TODAY.</strong>\nFORM HEADER rptdate &quot;Customer List&quot; AT 34\n  &quot;Page&quot; AT 66 PAGE-NUMBER FORMAT &quot;&gt;&gt;&gt;9&quot; SKIP(2)\n  WITH NO-BOX PAGE-TOP.\nVIEW.\n\nFOR EACH Customer NO-LOCK:\n  DISPLAY Customer.Name AT 1 Customer.Address AT 31\n    Customer.City + &quot;, &quot; + &quot; &quot; + Customer.State FORMAT &quot;x(35)&quot; AT 31\n    WITH NO-BOX NO-LABELS CENTERED.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <p class=\"p\">PAGE-TOP frames are re-evaluated on every new\npage. Therefore, if you do not use a variable for the date, a different\ndate is displayed on the following page(s) if the report starts\nbefore midnight and ends after midnight.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TODAY-function__see-also_GC1B1BN2705129\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d337887e163\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ADD-INTERVAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ADD-INTERVAL-function.html\">ADD-INTERVAL function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATE-function.html\">DATE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATE-FORMAT-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATE-FORMAT-attribute.html\">DATE-FORMAT attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATETIME-function.html\">DATETIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DATETIME-TZ-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DATETIME-TZ-function.html\">DATETIME-TZ function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DAY-function.html\">DAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ETIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ETIME-function.html\">ETIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"INTERVAL-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/INTERVAL-function.html\">INTERVAL function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ISO-DATE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ISO-DATE-function.html\">ISO-DATE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MONTH-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MONTH-function.html\">MONTH function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"MTIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/MTIME-function.html\">MTIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"NOW-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/NOW-function.html\">NOW function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIME-function.html\">TIME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIME-SOURCE-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIME-SOURCE-attribute.html\">TIME-SOURCE attribute</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIMEZONE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIMEZONE-function.html\">TIMEZONE function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"WEEKDAY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/WEEKDAY-function.html\">WEEKDAY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"YEAR-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/YEAR-function.html\">YEAR function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"YEAR-OFFSET-attribute.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/YEAR-OFFSET-attribute.html\">YEAR-OFFSET attribute</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TIMEZONE-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TIMEZONE-function.html\">TIMEZONE function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TO-ROWID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TO-ROWID-function.html\">TO-ROWID function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310835","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"TODAY function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TODAY-function.html","type":"Manual"}